OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright spells and some showers
OL,6,Fthrough the day, the odd one turning
OL,7,Fheavy in the afternoon. Best of the
OL,8,Fdry, bright weather in the southeast.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FClear spells and some showers
OL,11,Fin the evening. Scattered showers
OL,12,Fcontinue for Dumfries and Galloway
OL,13,Fovernight, but becoming dry with clear
OL,14,Fspells in the east.
OL,15,
OL,16,CWednesday:FDry and bright for many in
OL,17,Fthe morning, but a few showers in the
OL,18,Fsouthwest. Cloudier afternoon with
OL,19,Fsome showers before a band of heavy
OL,20,Frain pushes east in evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
